{:doc ["New-DSL conversion of ac/combat/abilities/storm_wing.edn (S6). Toggle"
        "flight ability (:release-keeps-session? true -- releasing the toggle"
        "button does not end flight, only :abort does) with an integer"
        ":phase state field (0 = charging, 1 = flying), ported as :long with"
        "math/eq, matching plasma_cannon.edn's same choice."
        ""
        ":terrain/random-break turned out to already exist as a :defn"
        "composite (combat-core/lib/random_break.edn, ported earlier this"
        "session before any real ac content exercised it) -- this is its"
        "first real ac call site, confirming the composite's own signature"
        "[origin radius attempts hardness-max] and its documented dropped"
        ":seed param (the new engine reads the activation's RNG cursor"
        "implicitly, same as random/chance). Initially misdiagnosed as an"
        "unwired vocab gap and given a duplicate :terrain/random-break vocab"
        "node before catching the mistake; that duplicate was reverted, not"
        "kept, since compile-call checks :fns (composites) before :vocab and"
        "would have shadowed it as dead code either way."
        ""
        "combat-core/run.clj's capability-type had a speculative"
        "\\\"movement\\\" :boolean case with no real content behind it. This"
        "ability is the first real usage of ?movement/*, and every one it"
        "reads (forward/right/back/left) is a direction VECTOR -- consumed"
        "both as motion/flight's :direction and as vfx orientation fields,"
        "never a boolean. Fixed to :vec3, the same class of \\\"first real"
        "usage reveals the original guess was wrong\\\" fix already applied to"
        ":target/raycast-fan's :yaw-range-degrees and :entity/spawn's"
        ":entity-type."
        ""
        "{:ref [:frame :seed]} (the old engine's per-dispatch RNG source,"
        "used to decorrelate the four vortex columns' particle patterns) maps"
        "to the same activation seed capability every other conversion this"
        "session already reads as ?rng/seed -- no new engine concept needed,"
        "just a different old-engine spelling for the same thing (mirroring"
        "plasma_cannon.edn's ability/caster :seed bind, which needed the"
        "identical translation)."
        ""
        "No top-level :session-state key at all (verified by grep -- genuinely"
        "absent), same as meltdowner.edn/mine_ray.edn's own already-documented"
        "cases; the new :program's own :state declaration is self-contained"
        "regardless."
        ""
        "The vortex-column vfx update block (four columns + particle + audio,"
        "identical structure) is repeated twice in the old :pulse (once right"
        "after the charge-time transition into phase 1, once every tick while"
        "already in phase 1) -- kept duplicated rather than factored into a"
        "shared :defn, the same choice already established for this session's"
        "other same-ability repeated blocks. Each update's own :alpha formula"
        "(select on phase==0) is always-false at BOTH of these call sites"
        "(phase is guaranteed already 1 by the time either block runs) but is"
        "ported as the full formula verbatim rather than simplified to the"
        "constant it always evaluates to -- this is ordinary logic that always"
        "takes one branch at runtime, not the syntactically-dead/unreferenced"
        "kind of code this migration's other conversions have dropped."]
 :schema-version 2
 :kind :ability
 :id :storm-wing
 :name-key "ability.skill.vecmanip.storm_wing"
 :description-key "ability.skill.vecmanip.storm_wing.desc"
 :revision 1
 :activation :toggle
 :release-keeps-session? true
 :requires [:caster/body :caster/id :world/id :charge/ticks]
 :tunables {:charge-time {:curve :mastery-lerp :type :int}
            :movement-acceleration {:curve :const}
            :movement-speed-exp-threshold {:curve :const}
            :movement-speed-multipliers {:curve :pair}
            :movement-speed-scale {:curve :pair}
            :hover-near-ground-velocity {:curve :const}
            :hover-air-velocity {:curve :const}
            :near-ground-distance {:curve :const}
            :near-ground-eye-height {:curve :const}
            :low-exp-threshold {:curve :const}
            :soft-block-tries {:curve :const :type :int}
            :soft-block-search-radius {:curve :const}
            :soft-hardness-max {:curve :const}
            :mastery-knockback-radius {:curve :const}
            :mastery-knockback-speed {:curve :pair}
            :cost-tick-cp {:curve :mastery-lerp}
            :cost-tick-overload {:curve :mastery-lerp}
            :cooldown-ticks {:curve :mastery-lerp :type :int}
            :exp-tick {:curve :const}}
 :costs {:flight {:resources {:cp {:ref [:input :tunables :cost-tick-cp]}
                              :overload {:ref [:input :tunables :cost-tick-overload]}}}}
 :cooldown {:main {:ticks {:ref [:input :tunables :cooldown-ticks]}}}
 :progression {:flight-tick {:per-mark {:ref [:input :tunables :exp-tick]}}}
 :program
 "{:ability :storm-wing
   :activation :toggle
   :state {:phase {:type :long :default 0} :charge-ticks {:type :long :default 0}
           :previous-can-fly? {:type :boolean :default false}
           :move-direction {:type :vec3 :default nil}}
   :tunables {:low-exp-threshold {:type :double} :soft-block-tries {:type :long}
              :soft-block-search-radius {:type :double} :soft-hardness-max {:type :double}
              :movement-speed-exp-threshold {:type :double}
              :movement-speed-multipliers {:type :any} :movement-speed-scale {:type :any}
              :near-ground-distance {:type :double} :near-ground-eye-height {:type :double}
              :hover-near-ground-velocity {:type :double} :hover-air-velocity {:type :double}
              :movement-acceleration {:type :double} :charge-time {:type :long}
              :mastery-knockback-radius {:type :double}
              :mastery-knockback-speed {:type :any}}
   :phases
   {:start
    [(let owner-snapshot (owner/snapshot {:projection [:can-fly?]}))
     (state! :phase 0)
     (state! :charge-ticks 0)
     (state! :previous-can-fly? (:can-fly? owner-snapshot))
     (owner/can-fly {:enabled? true})
     (let body ?caster/body)
     (let forward ?movement/forward)
     (let right ?movement/right)
     (let seed ?rng/seed)
     (vfx! {:effect-id :vortex-column-session :operation :spawn
           :instance-key [:activation :storm-wing-vortex-0] :audience {:type :nearby :radius 64.0}
           :payload {:count-limit 64 :life-ticks 30
                    :orientation {:anchor-offset [0.0 1.6 0.0] :pitch-scale 0.2
                                 :local-offset [-0.1 -0.3 0.1] :forward forward
                                 :back-tilt-degrees 70.0 :source :owner-body :up [0.0 1.0 0.0]
                                 :separation-z-degrees 45.0 :pre-translation [0.0 0.2 -0.5]
                                 :right right :separation-y-degrees 45.0}
                    :radius {:min 0.1 :max 0.16} :seed seed :alpha 0.0 :base body
                    :axis [0.0 1.0 0.0] :height 2.0 :spacing {:min 0.18 :max 0.32}}})
     (vfx! {:effect-id :vortex-column-session :operation :spawn
           :instance-key [:activation :storm-wing-vortex-1] :audience {:type :nearby :radius 64.0}
           :payload {:count-limit 64 :life-ticks 30
                    :orientation {:anchor-offset [0.0 1.6 0.0] :pitch-scale 0.2
                                 :local-offset [0.1 -0.3 0.1] :forward forward
                                 :back-tilt-degrees 70.0 :source :owner-body :up [0.0 1.0 0.0]
                                 :separation-z-degrees -45.0 :pre-translation [0.0 0.2 -0.5]
                                 :right right :separation-y-degrees -45.0}
                    :radius {:min 0.1 :max 0.16} :seed (long/add seed 1) :alpha 0.0 :base body
                    :axis [0.0 1.0 0.0] :height 2.0 :spacing {:min 0.18 :max 0.32}}})
     (vfx! {:effect-id :vortex-column-session :operation :spawn
           :instance-key [:activation :storm-wing-vortex-2] :audience {:type :nearby :radius 64.0}
           :payload {:count-limit 64 :life-ticks 30
                    :orientation {:anchor-offset [0.0 1.6 0.0] :pitch-scale 0.2
                                 :local-offset [-0.1 -0.5 -0.1] :forward forward
                                 :back-tilt-degrees 70.0 :source :owner-body :up [0.0 1.0 0.0]
                                 :separation-z-degrees 45.0 :pre-translation [0.0 0.2 -0.5]
                                 :right right :separation-y-degrees -45.0}
                    :radius {:min 0.1 :max 0.16} :seed (long/add seed 2) :alpha 0.0 :base body
                    :axis [0.0 1.0 0.0] :height 2.0 :spacing {:min 0.18 :max 0.32}}})
     (vfx! {:effect-id :vortex-column-session :operation :spawn
           :instance-key [:activation :storm-wing-vortex-3] :audience {:type :nearby :radius 64.0}
           :payload {:count-limit 64 :life-ticks 30
                    :orientation {:anchor-offset [0.0 1.6 0.0] :pitch-scale 0.2
                                 :local-offset [0.1 -0.5 -0.1] :forward forward
                                 :back-tilt-degrees 70.0 :source :owner-body :up [0.0 1.0 0.0]
                                 :separation-z-degrees -45.0 :pre-translation [0.0 0.2 -0.5]
                                 :right right :separation-y-degrees 45.0}
                    :radius {:min 0.1 :max 0.16} :seed (long/add seed 3) :alpha 0.0 :base body
                    :axis [0.0 1.0 0.0] :height 2.0 :spacing {:min 0.18 :max 0.32}}})
     (vfx! {:effect-id :particle-session :operation :spawn
           :instance-key [:activation :storm-wing-particles] :audience {:type :nearby :radius 64.0}
           :payload {:position body :rate-per-tick 12 :limit 256
                    :particle {:material :block-crack :block-id \"minecraft:dirt\" :life-ticks 12
                              :speed 1.0 :spawn-region {:type :sphere-shell :radius {:min 3.0 :max 8.0}}
                              :velocity {:type :tangent-swirl :axis [0.0 1.0 0.0] :radial-scale 0.7
                                        :vertical-jitter 0.06}
                              :spread {:x 8.0 :y 8.0 :z 8.0}}}})
     (vfx! {:effect-id :audio-loop-session :operation :spawn
           :instance-key [:activation :storm-wing-audio] :audience {:type :nearby :radius 64.0}
           :payload {:position body :sound-id \"academy:vecmanip.storm_wing\" :volume 0.5
                    :pitch 1.0}})
     (finish {:outcome :started})]

    :pulse
    [(let phase-before %phase)
     (let mastery ?progression/mastery)
     (let body ?caster/body)
     (let forward ?movement/forward)
     (let right ?movement/right)
     (let world-id ?world/id)
     (let move-direction %move-direction)
     (when (math/lt mastery $low-exp-threshold)
       (terrain/random-break body $soft-block-search-radius $soft-block-tries $soft-hardness-max))
     (let speed-multiplier
       (math/select (math/lt mastery $movement-speed-exp-threshold)
                    (pair/first $movement-speed-multipliers) (pair/second $movement-speed-multipliers)))
     (let speed-scale
       (math/lerp (pair/first $movement-speed-scale) (pair/second $movement-speed-scale) mastery))
     (motion/flight {:direction move-direction :speed (math/mul speed-multiplier speed-scale)
                     :reset-fall-damage? true :world-id world-id
                     :near-ground-distance $near-ground-distance
                     :near-ground-eye-height $near-ground-eye-height
                     :hover-near-ground-velocity $hover-near-ground-velocity
                     :hover-air-velocity $hover-air-velocity :acceleration $movement-acceleration})
     (if (math/eq phase-before 0)
       [(let charge-ticks-cur %charge-ticks)
        (let charge-ticks-next (long/add charge-ticks-cur 1))
        (state! :charge-ticks charge-ticks-next)
        (when (math/gt charge-ticks-next $charge-time)
          (state! :phase 1)
          (state! :charge-ticks 0)
          (when (math/gte mastery 1.0)
            (motion/radial-impulse body $mastery-knockback-radius
                                  (math/lerp (pair/first $mastery-knockback-speed)
                                            (pair/second $mastery-knockback-speed) mastery)
                                  128))
          (let current-phase 1)
          (let alpha
            (math/select (math/eq current-phase 0)
                         (math/mul 0.7 (math/clamp (math/div 0 $charge-time) 0.0 1.0)) 0.7))
          (vfx! {:effect-id :vortex-column-session :operation :update
                :instance-key [:activation :storm-wing-vortex-0]
                :payload {:base body :alpha alpha
                         :orientation {:anchor-offset [0.0 1.6 0.0] :pitch-scale 0.2
                                      :local-offset [-0.1 -0.3 0.1] :forward forward
                                      :back-tilt-degrees 70.0 :source :owner-body :up [0.0 1.0 0.0]
                                      :separation-z-degrees 45.0 :pre-translation [0.0 0.2 -0.5]
                                      :right right :separation-y-degrees 45.0}}})
          (vfx! {:effect-id :vortex-column-session :operation :update
                :instance-key [:activation :storm-wing-vortex-1]
                :payload {:base body :alpha alpha
                         :orientation {:anchor-offset [0.0 1.6 0.0] :pitch-scale 0.2
                                      :local-offset [0.1 -0.3 0.1] :forward forward
                                      :back-tilt-degrees 70.0 :source :owner-body :up [0.0 1.0 0.0]
                                      :separation-z-degrees -45.0 :pre-translation [0.0 0.2 -0.5]
                                      :right right :separation-y-degrees -45.0}}})
          (vfx! {:effect-id :vortex-column-session :operation :update
                :instance-key [:activation :storm-wing-vortex-2]
                :payload {:base body :alpha alpha
                         :orientation {:anchor-offset [0.0 1.6 0.0] :pitch-scale 0.2
                                      :local-offset [-0.1 -0.5 -0.1] :forward forward
                                      :back-tilt-degrees 70.0 :source :owner-body :up [0.0 1.0 0.0]
                                      :separation-z-degrees 45.0 :pre-translation [0.0 0.2 -0.5]
                                      :right right :separation-y-degrees -45.0}}})
          (vfx! {:effect-id :vortex-column-session :operation :update
                :instance-key [:activation :storm-wing-vortex-3]
                :payload {:base body :alpha alpha
                         :orientation {:anchor-offset [0.0 1.6 0.0] :pitch-scale 0.2
                                      :local-offset [0.1 -0.5 -0.1] :forward forward
                                      :back-tilt-degrees 70.0 :source :owner-body :up [0.0 1.0 0.0]
                                      :separation-z-degrees -45.0 :pre-translation [0.0 0.2 -0.5]
                                      :right right :separation-y-degrees 45.0}}})
          (vfx! {:effect-id :particle-session :operation :update
                :instance-key [:activation :storm-wing-particles] :payload {:position body}})
          (vfx! {:effect-id :audio-loop-session :operation :update
                :instance-key [:activation :storm-wing-audio] :payload {:position body}}))]
       [(let flight-tick-progression ?progression/flight-tick)
        (event! {:type :score/mark :tag :flight-tick :progression flight-tick-progression})
        (let charge-ticks-now %charge-ticks)
        (let alpha2
          (math/select (math/eq phase-before 0)
                       (math/mul 0.7 (math/clamp (math/div charge-ticks-now $charge-time) 0.0 1.0))
                       0.7))
        (vfx! {:effect-id :vortex-column-session :operation :update
              :instance-key [:activation :storm-wing-vortex-0]
              :payload {:base body :alpha alpha2
                       :orientation {:anchor-offset [0.0 1.6 0.0] :pitch-scale 0.2
                                    :local-offset [-0.1 -0.3 0.1] :forward forward
                                    :back-tilt-degrees 70.0 :source :owner-body :up [0.0 1.0 0.0]
                                    :separation-z-degrees 45.0 :pre-translation [0.0 0.2 -0.5]
                                    :right right :separation-y-degrees 45.0}}})
        (vfx! {:effect-id :vortex-column-session :operation :update
              :instance-key [:activation :storm-wing-vortex-1]
              :payload {:base body :alpha alpha2
                       :orientation {:anchor-offset [0.0 1.6 0.0] :pitch-scale 0.2
                                    :local-offset [0.1 -0.3 0.1] :forward forward
                                    :back-tilt-degrees 70.0 :source :owner-body :up [0.0 1.0 0.0]
                                    :separation-z-degrees -45.0 :pre-translation [0.0 0.2 -0.5]
                                    :right right :separation-y-degrees -45.0}}})
        (vfx! {:effect-id :vortex-column-session :operation :update
              :instance-key [:activation :storm-wing-vortex-2]
              :payload {:base body :alpha alpha2
                       :orientation {:anchor-offset [0.0 1.6 0.0] :pitch-scale 0.2
                                    :local-offset [-0.1 -0.5 -0.1] :forward forward
                                    :back-tilt-degrees 70.0 :source :owner-body :up [0.0 1.0 0.0]
                                    :separation-z-degrees 45.0 :pre-translation [0.0 0.2 -0.5]
                                    :right right :separation-y-degrees -45.0}}})
        (vfx! {:effect-id :vortex-column-session :operation :update
              :instance-key [:activation :storm-wing-vortex-3]
              :payload {:base body :alpha alpha2
                       :orientation {:anchor-offset [0.0 1.6 0.0] :pitch-scale 0.2
                                    :local-offset [0.1 -0.5 -0.1] :forward forward
                                    :back-tilt-degrees 70.0 :source :owner-body :up [0.0 1.0 0.0]
                                    :separation-z-degrees -45.0 :pre-translation [0.0 0.2 -0.5]
                                    :right right :separation-y-degrees 45.0}}})
        (vfx! {:effect-id :particle-session :operation :update
              :instance-key [:activation :storm-wing-particles] :payload {:position body}})
        (vfx! {:effect-id :audio-loop-session :operation :update
              :instance-key [:activation :storm-wing-audio] :payload {:position body}})
        (let flight-budget ?budget/flight)
        (let scale (math/select (math/eq phase-before 1) 1.0 0.0))
        (let sufficient? (cost/spend {:budget flight-budget :scale scale}))
        (when (bool/not sufficient?)
          (let previous-can-fly? %previous-can-fly?)
          (owner/can-fly {:enabled? previous-can-fly?})
          (let main-cooldown ?cooldown/main)
          (cooldown/start {:name :main :ticks main-cooldown})
          (vfx! {:effect-id :vortex-column-session :operation :destroy
                :instance-key [:activation :storm-wing-vortex-0] :payload {:fade-ticks 15}})
          (vfx! {:effect-id :vortex-column-session :operation :destroy
                :instance-key [:activation :storm-wing-vortex-1] :payload {:fade-ticks 15}})
          (vfx! {:effect-id :vortex-column-session :operation :destroy
                :instance-key [:activation :storm-wing-vortex-2] :payload {:fade-ticks 15}})
          (vfx! {:effect-id :vortex-column-session :operation :destroy
                :instance-key [:activation :storm-wing-vortex-3] :payload {:fade-ticks 15}})
          (vfx! {:effect-id :particle-session :operation :destroy
                :instance-key [:activation :storm-wing-particles] :payload {}})
          (vfx! {:effect-id :audio-loop-session :operation :destroy
                :instance-key [:activation :storm-wing-audio] :payload {:fade-ticks 0}})
          (finish {:outcome :insufficient-resource :end-ability? true}))])
     (finish {:outcome :continue})]

    :release
    [(finish {:outcome :continue})]

    :abort
    [(let previous-can-fly? %previous-can-fly?)
     (owner/can-fly {:enabled? previous-can-fly?})
     (let main-cooldown ?cooldown/main)
     (cooldown/start {:name :main :ticks main-cooldown})
     (vfx! {:effect-id :vortex-column-session :operation :destroy
           :instance-key [:activation :storm-wing-vortex-0] :payload {:fade-ticks 15}})
     (vfx! {:effect-id :vortex-column-session :operation :destroy
           :instance-key [:activation :storm-wing-vortex-1] :payload {:fade-ticks 15}})
     (vfx! {:effect-id :vortex-column-session :operation :destroy
           :instance-key [:activation :storm-wing-vortex-2] :payload {:fade-ticks 15}})
     (vfx! {:effect-id :vortex-column-session :operation :destroy
           :instance-key [:activation :storm-wing-vortex-3] :payload {:fade-ticks 15}})
     (vfx! {:effect-id :particle-session :operation :destroy
           :instance-key [:activation :storm-wing-particles] :payload {}})
     (vfx! {:effect-id :audio-loop-session :operation :destroy
           :instance-key [:activation :storm-wing-audio] :payload {:fade-ticks 0}})
     (finish {:outcome :aborted :end-ability? true})]

    :movement/right-press
    [(let phase %phase)
     (when (math/eq phase 1) (let dir ?movement/right) (state! :move-direction dir))]
    :movement/right-tick
    [(let phase %phase)
     (when (math/eq phase 1) (let dir ?movement/right) (state! :move-direction dir))]
    :movement/right-release
    [(state! :move-direction nil)]
    :movement/left-press
    [(let phase %phase)
     (when (math/eq phase 1) (let dir ?movement/left) (state! :move-direction dir))]
    :movement/left-tick
    [(let phase %phase)
     (when (math/eq phase 1) (let dir ?movement/left) (state! :move-direction dir))]
    :movement/left-release
    [(state! :move-direction nil)]
    :movement/forward-press
    [(let phase %phase)
     (when (math/eq phase 1) (let dir ?movement/forward) (state! :move-direction dir))]
    :movement/forward-tick
    [(let phase %phase)
     (when (math/eq phase 1) (let dir ?movement/forward) (state! :move-direction dir))]
    :movement/forward-release
    [(state! :move-direction nil)]
    :movement/back-press
    [(let phase %phase)
     (when (math/eq phase 1) (let dir ?movement/back) (state! :move-direction dir))]
    :movement/back-tick
    [(let phase %phase)
     (when (math/eq phase 1) (let dir ?movement/back) (state! :move-direction dir))]
    :movement/back-release
    [(state! :move-direction nil)]}}"
 :invariants nil
 :mark-policies nil}
